      "bug": {
        "description": "Manual #[fallback] dispatch used SolCall::abi_decode on selector-stripped slices. abi_decode validates data[..4] == Self::SELECTOR; the selector was already stripped by the fallback, so decode returned Err and the handler collapsed it to an empty revert (data: \"0x\").",
